1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
"Tamed"

2
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,800
(Episode 5: Surrendering in a Kiss)

3
00:01:36,659 --> 00:01:37,400
Long time no see.

4
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,400
Cheng Yu'an.

5
00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:40,259
My parents asked me
(Jin Yumo)

6
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:41,239
if you have time for

7
00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:42,560
dinner at our place.

8
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:43,840
I'm busy these days.

9
00:01:43,841 --> 00:01:44,881
Thank your parents for me.

10
00:02:16,180 --> 00:02:17,180
Lin Qi.

11
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,280
What are you doing?

12
00:02:18,580 --> 00:02:19,620
What were you hoping for?

13
00:02:38,273 --> 00:02:39,866
(Zhou Zhi)

14
00:02:41,020 --> 00:02:42,020
Hey, Lin Qi.

15
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:43,819
One of your dad's paintings turned up.

16
00:02:43,939 --> 00:02:45,699
It's just a bit out of the way.

17
00:02:46,099 --> 00:02:47,239
I can't handle this alone.

18
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,240
Are you free right now?

19
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:49,580
I am.

20
00:02:49,580 --> 00:02:50,400
Send me the address.

21
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,400
I'll come over.

22
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,359
How did that case turn out?

23
00:03:07,383 --> 00:03:08,383
Did you win?

24
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,840
Yeah.

25
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:10,879
OK.

26
00:03:10,879 --> 00:03:11,500
Glad to hear that.

27
00:03:11,659 --> 00:03:12,779
Then I won't keep you.

28
00:03:12,780 --> 00:03:13,979
Give my best to your parents.

29
00:03:14,139 --> 00:03:15,139
Yumo.

30
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:16,620
Thank you.

31
00:03:16,780 --> 00:03:18,860
Next time, there's no
need to come all this way.

32
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,199
I know.

33
00:03:20,199 --> 00:03:21,199
I was just passing by.

34
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:24,620
Cheng Yu'an.

35
00:03:24,659 --> 00:03:25,659
I really admire you.

36
00:03:26,139 --> 00:03:26,900
But don't worry.

37
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:27,900
I know my boundaries.

38
00:03:40,060 --> 00:03:40,860
Cheng Yu'an.

39
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:42,100
I'll go. Something came up.

40
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,600
I ate the cupcake, by the way.

41
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:44,340
Matcha flavor.

42
00:03:44,340 --> 00:03:45,340
Pretty good.

43
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,479
Sorry.

44
00:03:47,659 --> 00:03:50,099
The person you are
calling is not answering.

45
00:03:50,879 --> 00:03:52,259
Please try again later.

46
00:04:41,939 --> 00:04:44,339
What dessert flavors do you like?

47
00:04:45,540 --> 00:04:46,540
I don't eat sweets often.

48
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:48,540
You must have a favorite flavor.

49
00:04:51,459 --> 00:04:52,459
Matcha's fine.

50
00:05:01,519 --> 00:05:03,079
We're almost out of milk.

51
00:05:32,236 --> 00:05:33,236
(Lin Qi)

52
00:05:38,420 --> 00:05:39,220
Sorry.

53
00:05:39,379 --> 00:05:41,819
The person you are
calling is not answering.

54
00:05:42,699 --> 00:05:44,079
Please try again later.

55
00:06:05,423 --> 00:06:07,069
[The same message Lin Qi sent earlier]

56
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:52,719
I did find it,

57
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,040
but the place...

58
00:06:55,019 --> 00:06:56,019
Never mind.

59
00:06:56,579 --> 00:06:57,699
Here's the painting.

60
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,240
Back in one piece.

61
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:00,739
And I brought him back, too.

62
00:07:00,740 --> 00:07:01,740
In one...

63
00:07:04,019 --> 00:07:05,319
well, mostly
in one piece.

64
00:07:10,060 --> 00:07:11,060
OK. I'll head out.

65
00:07:21,579 --> 00:07:22,579
Go sit on the couch.

66
00:08:32,980 --> 00:08:33,980
Where were you?

67
00:08:34,580 --> 00:08:35,740
How did you get hurt?

68
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:38,220
He's only asking as a formality.

69
00:08:38,519 --> 00:08:39,779
Don't read too much into it.

70
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:41,879
Answer me.

71
00:08:45,139 --> 00:08:47,340
I didn't break the pet residence rules.

72
00:08:49,019 --> 00:08:50,279
As for where I go,

73
00:08:50,700 --> 00:08:52,019
that's up to me.

74
00:08:55,919 --> 00:08:57,559
Why did you leave the bakery on your own?

75
00:08:57,639 --> 00:08:59,299
Why go when you knew it was dangerous?

76
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:01,000
Why do you keep getting hurt?

77
00:09:01,159 --> 00:09:04,340
Is a painting more important than you?

78
00:09:18,299 --> 00:09:20,860
How did you get this painting?

79
00:09:21,779 --> 00:09:23,259
I had someone track it down.

80
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,480
When?

81
00:09:25,039 --> 00:09:25,860
Three days ago.

82
00:09:25,861 --> 00:09:27,079
Why didn't you tell me?

83
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,179
Tell you?

84
00:09:28,399 --> 00:09:29,399
And then what?

85
00:09:30,139 --> 00:09:31,740
Let you rush into danger alone?

86
00:09:32,139 --> 00:09:33,500
That's my business.

87
00:09:35,259 --> 00:09:36,439
Your business?

88
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,620
You snuck out,

89
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,799
went somewhere like that,

90
00:09:40,179 --> 00:09:41,299
and came back hurt.

91
00:09:41,620 --> 00:09:42,740
Now you're telling me,

92
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:44,500
"That's my business"?

93
00:09:45,799 --> 00:09:46,659
Lin Qi.

94
00:09:46,820 --> 00:09:48,139
You live under my roof.

95
00:09:49,039 --> 00:09:52,259
Your business is my business.

96
00:09:54,779 --> 00:09:55,779
What gives you the right?

97
00:09:56,659 --> 00:09:58,539
Is it that Pet Code?

98
00:09:58,759 --> 00:10:01,379
Or that I live here with
nowhere else to go?

99
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:04,659
You're just putting me up for now.

100
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,138
Where I go,

101
00:10:06,139 --> 00:10:06,899
what I do,

102
00:10:06,980 --> 00:10:07,860
what I care about...

103
00:10:07,861 --> 00:10:08,899
None of it is your...

104
00:10:52,220 --> 00:10:53,220
Lin Qi.

105
00:11:24,700 --> 00:11:25,700
Hello?

106
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:26,759
Hello, Lin Qi?

107
00:11:26,860 --> 00:11:27,940
Your mother is awake!

108
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,000
My mom's awake?

109
00:11:30,139 --> 00:11:30,500
OK.

110
00:11:30,500 --> 00:11:31,500
I'll be right there.

111
00:11:33,419 --> 00:11:34,419
I'll drive you.

112
00:11:34,639 --> 00:11:35,340
No need.

113
00:11:35,340 --> 00:11:36,340
My mom just woke up.

114
00:11:36,559 --> 00:11:37,679
She won't see outsiders yet.

115
00:11:42,379 --> 00:11:43,379
Outsiders?

116
00:11:54,980 --> 00:11:56,039
Qiqi.

117
00:11:56,799 --> 00:11:57,799
You're back.

118
00:11:59,019 --> 00:11:59,500
Mom.

119
00:11:59,879 --> 00:12:01,399
You're finally awake.

120
00:12:02,500 --> 00:12:03,500
Sweetheart,

121
00:12:04,179 --> 00:12:05,179
Don't cry.

122
00:12:05,639 --> 00:12:06,700
I'm fine.

123
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:08,600
How do you feel?

124
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,659
Is anything bothering you?

125
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:12,320
I feel fine.

126
00:12:13,379 --> 00:12:14,700
I'm much better.

127
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:17,799
The nurse said you're still weak.

128
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:20,080
You need to rest.

129
00:12:21,779 --> 00:12:24,820
The nurse is exaggerating.

130
00:12:37,539 --> 00:12:38,539
Does it hurt?

131
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,600
No.

132
00:12:41,220 --> 00:12:43,820
It only hurt when the needle went in.

133
00:12:44,639 --> 00:12:46,419
It stopped hurting after that.

134
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,879
You always say it doesn't hurt.

135
00:12:52,779 --> 00:12:54,059
I'm not like you.

136
00:12:54,860 --> 00:12:56,820
You fell once as a child

137
00:12:57,700 --> 00:12:59,179
and cried all night.

138
00:13:11,559 --> 00:13:12,559
Mom.

139
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:14,919
I'll get some warm water to wipe you down.

140
00:13:15,639 --> 00:13:16,639
Okay.

141
00:13:34,679 --> 00:13:35,879
Honey! Honey, I'm here!

142
00:13:37,039 --> 00:13:38,039
Sorry about that.

143
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:44,960
Oh no.

144
00:13:45,059 --> 00:13:46,299
It died.

145
00:13:48,740 --> 00:13:49,240
Forget it.

146
00:13:49,241 --> 00:13:50,481
I'll have it repaired tomorrow.

147
00:13:51,820 --> 00:13:52,820
Thanks.

148
00:13:59,436 --> 00:14:02,250
[Cheng Yuze badgering
him about not responding]

149
00:14:03,620 --> 00:14:04,379
Dr. Shen.

150
00:14:04,380 --> 00:14:06,139
Your next patient is here for counseling.

151
00:14:06,399 --> 00:14:07,240
Send him in.

152
00:14:07,399 --> 00:14:08,399
OK.

153
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,200
Have a seat.

154
00:14:24,019 --> 00:14:25,019
What are you doing here?

155
00:14:25,220 --> 00:14:26,299
I booked an appointment.

156
00:14:26,620 --> 00:14:27,620
I paid.

157
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:30,779
I didn't schedule you.

158
00:14:31,059 --> 00:14:32,419
Scheduling me is your choice.

159
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,779
Showing up is mine.

160
00:14:35,759 --> 00:14:36,759
You didn't sleep well?

161
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:39,980
You tell me.

162
00:14:47,220 --> 00:14:48,379
Busy with work.

163
00:14:50,519 --> 00:14:51,638
You avoided me for seven days.

164
00:14:51,639 --> 00:14:52,379
Shen Mo.

165
00:14:52,639 --> 00:14:53,840
Not answering my calls,

166
00:14:54,179 --> 00:14:55,419
or replying to my texts.

167
00:14:57,539 --> 00:14:59,299
I thought something
fucking happened to you.

168
00:15:01,419 --> 00:15:02,419
I wasn't avoiding you.

169
00:15:03,139 --> 00:15:04,139
I really was busy.

170
00:15:10,139 --> 00:15:11,220
Look at me and say it.

171
00:15:14,340 --> 00:15:15,799
Look at me and say it.

172
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:17,460
You don't like me.

173
00:15:18,620 --> 00:15:19,940
Say it, and I'll leave.

174
00:15:22,860 --> 00:15:24,019
Say it!

175
00:15:24,620 --> 00:15:25,899
It's not that I don't like you.

176
00:15:29,460 --> 00:15:31,339
I like you.

177
00:15:31,340 --> 00:15:32,940
I like you, OK?

178
00:15:33,879 --> 00:15:35,440
Ever since I first met you.

179
00:15:37,159 --> 00:15:38,979
Since you grabbed my tie in the alley

180
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:40,299
to make sure I loved you.

181
00:15:40,980 --> 00:15:42,259
I've liked you all along.

182
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,320
Satisfied?

183
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,320
Is that enough?

184
00:15:49,700 --> 00:15:50,860
But I can't.

185
00:15:52,799 --> 00:15:53,840
Because of my dad?

186
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,399
You're my brother's therapist and mine,

187
00:15:58,259 --> 00:15:59,539
and my dad's spy.

188
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:01,279
Watching my brother,

189
00:16:02,039 --> 00:16:03,340
watching me.

190
00:16:03,659 --> 00:16:06,859
He hired you from day one.

191
00:16:06,860 --> 00:16:07,860
Right?

192
00:16:10,539 --> 00:16:11,779
So what?

193
00:16:12,399 --> 00:16:13,639
I'm asking you, Shen Mo:

194
00:16:14,139 --> 00:16:15,700
are you his

195
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,379
or mine?

196
00:16:19,679 --> 00:16:20,679
Answer me.

197
00:16:22,399 --> 00:16:23,820
I don't belong to anyone.

198
00:16:24,940 --> 00:16:25,940
That's not what I asked.

199
00:16:26,519 --> 00:16:27,960
I don't care who you are.

200
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:30,940
I don't care what anyone else says.

201
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:33,039
Just tell me one thing.

202
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,120
Do you want me?

203
00:16:39,879 --> 00:16:41,240
If you don't love me,

204
00:16:41,740 --> 00:16:42,940
push me away.

205
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,240
Right now.

206
00:16:45,379 --> 00:16:46,379
Immediately.

207
00:16:56,519 --> 00:16:57,519
It's been five seconds.

208
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:00,740
You haven't pushed me away.

209
00:17:10,299 --> 00:17:11,460
So you do want me.

210
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:15,460
Let go.

211
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:18,099
Cheng Yuze, let go.

212
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:43,000
Unless your brother sends
you here just for show,

213
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:45,440
don't come for counseling again.

214
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:48,279
I won't provide any therapy or counseling.

215
00:17:51,500 --> 00:17:53,019
I'm not someone you should love.

216
00:17:55,339 --> 00:17:56,779
We're done.

217
00:18:24,660 --> 00:18:25,660
Take a look.

218
00:18:27,336 --> 00:18:28,456
[Economic news, art used
for money laundering]

219
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:30,018
An exclusive report:

220
00:18:30,019 --> 00:18:31,999
key audio in the Lin Yuanshan artwork case.

221
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:34,480
The Cheng family drove up painting prices,

222
00:18:34,779 --> 00:18:37,278
creating a steady channel
for artwork money laundering.

223
00:18:37,279 --> 00:18:39,338
Cheng Group shares
hit their daily lower limit,

224
00:18:39,339 --> 00:18:40,818
erasing nearly 10 billion in market value.

225
00:18:40,819 --> 00:18:42,200
Tomorrow morning,

226
00:18:44,519 --> 00:18:45,700
hold a press conference.

227
00:18:46,539 --> 00:18:47,539
To announce what?

228
00:18:48,500 --> 00:18:51,618
Lin Yuanshan's "Way Back,"
with a double inscription,

229
00:18:51,619 --> 00:18:52,979
was legally acquired by the Group.

230
00:18:53,519 --> 00:18:54,919
You'll assist with the investigation,

231
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:56,200
find the heir,

232
00:18:56,759 --> 00:18:57,880
and arrange the transfer.

233
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:59,640
But we never bought that painting, right?

234
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:01,960
Whether we acquired it doesn't matter.

235
00:19:02,380 --> 00:19:03,939
Right now, this painting

236
00:19:03,940 --> 00:19:05,859
is the Group's only shield.

237
00:19:06,140 --> 00:19:07,819
It belongs to Lin Yuanshan's son.

238
00:19:08,579 --> 00:19:10,099
I have no right to decide for him.

239
00:19:10,259 --> 00:19:12,559
Lin Yuanshan's son?

240
00:19:14,799 --> 00:19:16,379
This painting is the only thing

241
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:18,920
that can get the Group out of this crisis.

242
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:21,818
You'll speak at tomorrow's
press conference.

243
00:19:21,819 --> 00:19:22,819
I can't.

244
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:24,220
Cheng Yu'an.

245
00:19:24,339 --> 00:19:26,380
The company has thousands of employees,

246
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:28,599
thousands of families.

247
00:19:29,059 --> 00:19:30,099
If the Group collapses,

248
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:31,480
what will happen to them?

249
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:36,059
You're protecting a painting for
someone you don't even know.

250
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:39,579
But who will protect
those thousands of families?

251
00:19:50,759 --> 00:19:51,759
What time?

252
00:19:53,339 --> 00:19:54,819
Tomorrow at 9 a.m.

253
00:19:55,259 --> 00:19:56,259
By the way,

254
00:19:56,339 --> 00:19:57,579
in 20 minutes,

255
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:00,140
the Group will hold a PR meeting.

256
00:20:08,180 --> 00:20:08,660
Hey.

257
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:09,500
Lin Qi.

258
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:10,480
What a coincidence.

259
00:20:10,599 --> 00:20:11,400
Here, this is for you.

260
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,400
Second cup's half off.

261
00:20:12,599 --> 00:20:14,140
Zhou Zhi? What
are you doing here?

262
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:15,419
A friend broke a bone.

263
00:20:15,420 --> 00:20:15,980
I came to visit,

264
00:20:16,339 --> 00:20:17,339
and got a drink, too.

265
00:20:17,420 --> 00:20:17,819
I must say,

266
00:20:17,819 --> 00:20:18,559
this latte's good.

267
00:20:18,560 --> 00:20:20,058
Tomorrow morning, Cheng Group

268
00:20:20,059 --> 00:20:21,495
will hold an emergency press conference

269
00:20:21,519 --> 00:20:23,598
on the Lin Yuanshan forgery case.

270
00:20:23,599 --> 00:20:24,559
Did you hear that?

271
00:20:24,560 --> 00:20:25,900
It's about Cheng Group again.

272
00:20:26,859 --> 00:20:28,059
WeChat Moments is blowing up.

273
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:29,755
They say Lin Yuanshan's final work,

274
00:20:29,779 --> 00:20:31,019
the original, has surfaced.

275
00:20:31,380 --> 00:20:32,740
It's the real thing!

276
00:20:33,180 --> 00:20:34,180
Real or not,

277
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:35,560
it's the top trending topic.

278
00:20:35,839 --> 00:20:37,778
Even Lin Yuanshan's name is trending!

279
00:20:37,779 --> 00:20:38,779
Exactly.

280
00:20:38,940 --> 00:20:39,900
Look at this.

281
00:20:39,901 --> 00:20:41,358
Apparently, tomorrow morning,

282
00:20:41,359 --> 00:20:42,799
they'll hold a press conference.

283
00:20:43,640 --> 00:20:44,640
This...

284
00:20:45,339 --> 00:20:46,579
My father's final work...

285
00:20:47,079 --> 00:20:48,440
is with the Cheng Group?

286
00:20:49,420 --> 00:20:51,279
Why hasn't he told me?

287
00:20:52,700 --> 00:20:54,402
Zhou Zhi, can I use your
phone to make a call?

288
00:20:54,759 --> 00:20:55,960
Right now,

289
00:20:56,099 --> 00:20:58,480
he's probably holding an
emergency meeting at work.

290
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:05,578
The press conference is
at 9 tomorrow morning.

291
00:21:05,579 --> 00:21:06,440
Need a ride there?

292
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,119
Sorry.

293
00:21:07,120 --> 00:21:09,719
The person you are
calling is not answering.

294
00:21:09,720 --> 00:21:11,740
I want to go and ask him myself.

295
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,841
OK. I'll pick you up
tomorrow morning.

296
00:21:14,660 --> 00:21:16,039
But knowing him,

297
00:21:16,759 --> 00:21:17,799
he wouldn't do this.

298
00:21:28,900 --> 00:21:31,420
Cheng Group hereby declares:

299
00:21:31,839 --> 00:21:33,758
The so-called internal recording online

300
00:21:33,759 --> 00:21:35,339
was maliciously edited and faked.

301
00:21:35,619 --> 00:21:36,639
Also,

302
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:38,459
Lin Yuanshan's original "Way Back"

303
00:21:38,460 --> 00:21:40,299
was legally acquired by Cheng Group.

304
00:21:41,099 --> 00:21:43,699
The Group is actively
seeking the rightful heir

305
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:44,940
to handle the paperwork.

306
00:21:46,859 --> 00:21:47,700
Mr. Cheng,

307
00:21:47,701 --> 00:21:50,740
Did Cheng Group use this
painting to launder money?

308
00:21:51,279 --> 00:21:52,759
Art's value lies in its legacy,

309
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:54,200
not in speculation.

310
00:21:55,559 --> 00:21:58,740
Is the heir you mentioned
Lin Yuanshan's son, Lin Qi?

311
00:22:04,559 --> 00:22:07,338
Anyone with information is welcome

312
00:22:07,339 --> 00:22:08,539
to contact the Group.

313
00:22:16,779 --> 00:22:17,779
Cheng Yu'an.

314
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:18,680
So...

315
00:22:18,779 --> 00:22:20,180
Which one's the real you?

316
00:22:41,579 --> 00:22:43,880
The person you are
calling is not answering.

317
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,000
Sorry.

318
00:22:46,319 --> 00:22:47,920
Whatever the news says tomorrow,

319
00:22:48,599 --> 00:22:49,599
don't believe it.

320
00:22:50,420 --> 00:22:51,420
Wait till I explain.

321
00:22:59,140 --> 00:23:00,019
(Next Episode)
Happy birthday.

322
00:23:00,019 --> 00:23:00,799
Lin Qi.

323
00:23:00,800 --> 00:23:01,919
It's not what you think.

324
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:03,676
That painting... I was
trying to protect it.

325
00:23:03,700 --> 00:23:05,680
Is that how you protect it?

326
00:23:06,420 --> 00:23:08,119
In front of the entire nation's media?

327
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:11,220
Using it as a bargaining chip?

328
00:23:12,180 --> 00:23:13,180
Lin Qi.

329
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:15,240
I love you.

330
00:23:15,539 --> 00:23:17,799
I'm hopelessly in love with you.

331
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:19,440
Don't go.

332
00:23:20,319 --> 00:23:21,319
Please?

333
00:23:21,460 --> 00:23:23,480
If you ever do this again,

334
00:23:24,099 --> 00:23:25,259
I'll never...
